nspiring technological innovation and ground-breaking science. It is also the story of what happens when the world's most expensive experiment blows up, of neutrinos that may or may not travel faster than light, and the reality of life in an underground bunker in Switzerland. This book will also leave you with a working knowledge of the new physics and what the discovery of the Higgs particle means for how we define the laws of nature. It will take you to the cutting edge of modern scientific thinking.","pageCount":287,"publicationYear":2014,"subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Career in physics","sourceId":"source-open-library-smashing-physics-jon-butterworth"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Large Hadron Collider (France and Switzerland)","sourceId":"source-open-library-smashing-physics-jon-butterworth"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Higgs bosons","sourceId":"source-open-library-smashing-physics-jon-butterworth"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"European Organization for Nuclear Research","sourceId":"source-open-library-smashing-physics-jon-butterworth"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Physique nucléaire","sourceId":"source-open-library-smashing-physics-jon-butterworth"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"CERN","sourceId":"source-open-library-smashing-physics-jon-butterworth"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Recherche scientifique","sourceId":"source-open-library-smashing-physics-jon-butterworth"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Recherche nucléaire","sourceId":"source-open-library-smashing-physics-jon-butterworth"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Accélérateurs de particules","sourceId":"source-open-library-smashing-physics-jon-butterworth"},{"source"